[00:00.000] 作词 : Sedona Schat/Noah Yoo
[00:00.034] 作曲 : Sedona Schat/Noah Yoo
[00:00.069]Where did you learn what it means to reciprocate? (你是从哪学来“回应”的意思的？)
[00:06.097]And how much can I be expected to tolerate? (而我又能容忍多少呢)
[00:12.370]So I started to think about the plans I made, the debt unpaid (所以我开始思考我制定的计划、还未偿还的债务)
[00:19.399]And you just can't call a spade a spade (你就是不可以直言不讳)
[00:25.925]I watch the moon, let it run my mood (望着月亮，让情绪释放)
[00:33.960]Can't stop thinking of you (无法停止想着你)
[00:38.980]I watch you (And I watch as things play out like) (我看着你（也看着事情这样发展下去）)
[00:45.507]So long nice to know you, I'll be moving on (很高兴认识你，我会继续生活)
[00:52.033]We started off in such a nice place (一切都开始得如此美好)
[00:55.297]We were talking the same language (我们是这么相互理解)
[00:58.309]I open, and I'm closing (我敞开心扉 又回避逃离)
[01:04.173]You can't stand the thought (你无法相信)
[01:08.085]Of a real beating heart, you'd be holding (你的心真的悸动了)
[01:08.838]Having trouble, uh-oh, owning (你陷入麻烦了，啊哦)
[01:11.098]And admit that I am hoping (我要承认我希望你这样啊)
[01:15.114]I watch the moon, let it run my mood (我望着月亮 情绪流转)
[01:22.895]Can't stop thinking of you (无法停止想念你)
[01:27.915]I watch you (And I watch as things play out like) (我望着你（看着事情就这样发展下去）)
[01:34.442]So long nice to know you, I'll be moving on (很高兴遇见你，我要继续前行)
[01:40.716]Moving on (继续着人生)
[02:10.336]You, yeah I always know the truth (你啊 我一直知道事实)
[02:17.715]But I can't just say it to you (只是不能对你说)
[02:18.471]Yeah. I know the truth (是的 我知道你的想法)
[02:22.987]I knew, yeah I always knew the truth (一直以来都知道)
[02:27.757]But I can't just say it to you (但我不能对你说)
[02:31.523]Yeah. I know the truth (是的 我清楚事实)
[02:37.297]I never thought we'd see it through (从未想过我们会挑明情感)
[02:40.058]I never could rely on you (我永远不能依赖你)
[02:43.321]And a few times your face came (而那几次你的脸)
[02:48.339]into view (进入视野)
[02:52.105]Into view (进入视野)
[02:55.118]I'm not into you (我一定不喜欢你吧)
[02:58.131]into view (可你闯入我的视野)